{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52525","headline":"山游怀古 · 陈元光","name":"山游怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迅烈驱黎瘴，委蛇陡翠微。\n汉宫尘漠漠，随社黍离离。\n圣远津稀问，蟾升树亦辉。\n晨昏童冠浴，夜静士民嬉。\n边檄兴师旅，秋深近阻饥。\n仲由刚协力，曾点志同时。\n倚曲酬歌去，宣尼正哂而。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}